WEBVTT

00:43.820 --> 00:46.790
Sebastian!

00:46.790 --> 00:48.860
Hmm? Oh, Queen Laura!

00:48.860 --> 00:51.980
Whatever are you doing in the servants' 
quarters? Please return immediately!

00:51.980 --> 00:54.910
Oh, don't be so stuffy!

00:54.910 --> 00:56.300
Nevertheless...

00:56.300 --> 00:59.100
Has Clarke come home?

00:59.100 --> 01:01.920
I believe he will be returning tomorrow.

01:02.440 --> 01:04.120
Hmm...

01:04.780 --> 01:07.170
And what about the girl?

01:07.480 --> 01:10.360
Pardon? What girl?

01:10.360 --> 01:14.710
Oh, you! You know the one.

01:14.710 --> 01:20.180
She made a big scene at the 
evening ball, then just up and split.

01:20.180 --> 01:22.350
<i>That</i> girl.

01:22.940 --> 01:25.310
Might you mean Lady Leticia?

01:25.630 --> 01:30.070
I would simply <i>love</i> to see
 Leticia Dorman.

01:30.640 --> 01:32.490
Er...

03:12.080 --> 03:15.810
Let me go!

03:17.400 --> 03:19.200
But if I do that, you'll run away.

03:19.200 --> 03:20.470
Put me down!

03:20.470 --> 03:21.680
Nope.

03:21.680 --> 03:23.280
Ugh...

03:23.670 --> 03:25.480
My, don't you two get along!

03:25.480 --> 03:29.440
Prince Clarke, please forgive
 our poor hospitality.

03:29.440 --> 03:33.580
Oh, don't worry about it. I'm not here 
on official business today anyway.

03:35.440 --> 03:37.610
The carriage awaits you.

03:37.610 --> 03:39.230
Thank you, Nadir.

03:40.420 --> 03:42.550
Brother, what about your promise?!

03:42.550 --> 03:46.670
Your Highness, we'll proceed without
 delay on that plan we discussed.

03:46.670 --> 03:48.460
Don't you ignore me!

03:48.460 --> 03:50.820
And what's this about a plan?

03:50.820 --> 03:51.860
Sounds good!

03:53.800 --> 03:54.960
Hmph.

03:55.420 --> 03:57.920
Duke Dorman, Duchess...

03:57.920 --> 04:02.030
Please accept my apologies 
for disturbing you at so late an hour.

04:02.430 --> 04:03.580
Goodness.

04:03.580 --> 04:07.060
You flatter us with such 
consideration, Your Highness.

04:07.980 --> 04:10.190
Father? Mother?

04:12.160 --> 04:14.620
This is no laughing matter!

04:27.660 --> 04:28.640
"I"?

04:29.370 --> 04:30.870
"Wish"?

04:30.870 --> 04:31.680
"You"?

04:31.680 --> 04:32.540
"Hap"?

04:32.540 --> 04:33.830
"Pi..."?

04:34.570 --> 04:37.840
"I wish you happiness"?! Lily!

04:39.630 --> 04:41.920
Okay, Lettie, shall we be off?

04:41.920 --> 04:42.840
Bwuh?!

04:42.840 --> 04:43.830
Ouch!

04:43.830 --> 04:47.520
Oh, I'm sorry! But let me go! Put me down!

04:47.520 --> 04:54.240
If I'd known it'd come to this, 
I would've spent more time working out!

04:59.210 --> 05:01.660
I don't even have Lily with me anymore...

05:01.660 --> 05:02.860
Do you hate me now?

05:02.860 --> 05:03.700
Hmm?

05:04.540 --> 05:07.330
For taking you away like this?

05:08.110 --> 05:09.200
No.

05:12.480 --> 05:14.390
But I don't like you either.

05:17.180 --> 05:19.470
Have you at least started to take an interest?

05:19.870 --> 05:21.470
In what?

05:22.200 --> 05:23.340
In me.

05:24.320 --> 05:25.140
Huh?

05:25.660 --> 05:29.640
I'm asking if you're interested 
in me. As a man.

05:30.080 --> 05:31.960
As a... man?

05:33.180 --> 05:37.220
It's true that I've never seen
 Prince Clarke in that way before.

05:37.220 --> 05:41.150
He was my fiancé, sure, but that was
 nothing more than a title to me.

05:41.150 --> 05:43.850
I've never really given any
 thought to the man behind it.

05:43.850 --> 05:46.660
Gosh, does that make me a terrible person?

05:54.390 --> 05:55.240
Is something wrong?

05:55.240 --> 05:56.600
You're moving so fast!

05:56.600 --> 05:59.480
I'm delighted we finally have 
a chance to talk to each other.

05:59.480 --> 06:01.340
We've talked to each other before!

06:01.340 --> 06:04.340
But you were never truly looking at me.

06:07.150 --> 06:08.350
Um...

06:08.650 --> 06:09.650
Hmm?

06:10.220 --> 06:12.130
You're too close!

06:12.520 --> 06:13.490
Am I?

06:18.340 --> 06:19.910
Let me see your face.

06:22.720 --> 06:24.560
We have all the time we need...

06:25.860 --> 06:26.530
Lettie.

06:29.460 --> 06:32.220
The prince made an official declaration.

06:32.220 --> 06:34.580
He will only produce heirs with you.

06:35.450 --> 06:36.640
Stop it!

06:35.450 --> 06:36.640
Oh, ouch.

06:38.960 --> 06:40.320
That's enough!

06:47.100 --> 06:50.950
Oh! I-I'm terribly sorry! Um...

06:50.950 --> 06:53.310
It's fine, Lettie.

06:53.610 --> 06:56.550
We won't arrive for some time yet,
so why don't we rest?

06:57.690 --> 07:01.080
Wuh? Uh...

07:02.240 --> 07:04.470
Good night, Lettie.

07:09.200 --> 07:11.500
<i>How could I sleep like this?!</i>

07:22.210 --> 07:25.260
Lettie? Lettie!

07:25.260 --> 07:26.180
Huh?!

07:26.970 --> 07:27.880
What?

07:28.520 --> 07:31.960
Good morning, Lettie. 
We've reached the castle.

07:31.960 --> 07:33.020
Oh, wuh?

07:33.450 --> 07:35.730
There's something I'd like to show you.

07:35.730 --> 07:37.280
Will you come on out?

07:39.290 --> 07:40.440
Yes.

07:55.660 --> 07:58.170
Wow!

07:58.170 --> 08:00.410
This is great!

08:00.410 --> 08:01.550
I made it.

08:01.550 --> 08:02.920
What?

08:03.440 --> 08:05.480
You like nature, don't you, Lettie?

08:05.480 --> 08:07.330
You can even go fishing here.

08:07.330 --> 08:08.680
Wuh?

08:11.870 --> 08:13.370
Wow!

08:13.370 --> 08:14.430
Happy?

08:14.990 --> 08:16.000
Yes!

08:16.000 --> 08:17.310
I'm glad.

08:17.310 --> 08:18.220
Oh!

08:19.700 --> 08:23.430
Even when we're married, I want you 
to be free to do what you enjoy.

08:23.430 --> 08:24.530
Huh?

08:25.130 --> 08:27.150
You are a proper lady now.

08:27.800 --> 08:29.530
Let's end your princess lessons.

08:29.530 --> 08:31.880
Is that even allowed?

08:31.880 --> 08:36.930
Sure it is. I won't hear of any complaints. 
Besides, I've already gotten permission.

08:36.930 --> 08:39.540
Permission? From whom?

08:39.900 --> 08:42.540
From His Majesty the King, 
of course. My father!

08:42.540 --> 08:44.800
What? Really?

08:44.800 --> 08:47.050
When I told him I'd never 
marry anyone but you...

08:47.050 --> 08:47.750
Huh?

08:47.750 --> 08:50.170
And that if he did anything 
to make you run away,

08:50.170 --> 08:52.510
he might never have grandchildren...

08:52.510 --> 08:53.610
Oh?

08:53.610 --> 08:55.110
He gave the okay!

08:56.030 --> 08:58.910
Wuh? Without even asking me?

08:59.560 --> 09:00.510
And so...

09:07.540 --> 09:08.800
Let's get married.

09:12.650 --> 09:13.700
No way.

09:16.630 --> 09:20.510
It's not a bad deal for you, though.
Instead of marrying into a lesser family,

09:20.510 --> 09:23.510
I can promise you a life of leisure here.

09:24.070 --> 09:25.210
No way.

09:27.190 --> 09:30.620
If you'll be forced to marry
 eventually anyway,

09:30.620 --> 09:33.220
why not this prime real estate
 right before you?

09:33.820 --> 09:34.720
No. Way.

09:36.960 --> 09:38.760
What part of this dissatisfies you?

09:40.240 --> 09:42.090
The marrying into the royal family part.

09:43.240 --> 09:46.350
That's the one thing 
I'll have to ask you to brook.

09:47.670 --> 09:49.570
I absolutely refuse.

09:54.020 --> 09:55.900
That is unfortunate, Lettie.

09:56.390 --> 09:58.520
I didn't want to have to resort to this, but...

09:59.080 --> 10:00.700
Wuh?

10:00.700 --> 10:04.850
I'd like you to stay here for a time, until 
preparations for the ceremony are complete.

10:05.440 --> 10:08.170
Be a good girl now, Lettie.

10:10.220 --> 10:11.130
W-Wait!

10:27.290 --> 10:29.170
This won't open either...

10:29.750 --> 10:30.940
Oh no!

10:36.820 --> 10:40.840
It's such a lovely room,
 but I'm not happy here at all.

10:44.330 --> 10:49.000
I'm exhausted. I'm so tired I can't move.

10:55.440 --> 10:57.300
I caught a real big one!

11:00.100 --> 11:03.100
Oh yeah!

11:12.030 --> 11:13.860
I finally got to see you.

11:21.270 --> 11:22.910
I want to see the real you.

11:23.820 --> 11:25.660
What about your wedding dress?

11:26.340 --> 11:27.750
We're all alone now.

11:27.750 --> 11:29.100
Let's get married...

11:29.100 --> 11:30.170
Lettie.

11:30.170 --> 11:31.220
Lettie!

11:31.220 --> 11:32.220
Lettie.

11:32.920 --> 11:41.060
Lettie... Lettie... Lettie... Lettie...
Lettie... Lettie... Lettie... Lettie...

11:35.020 --> 11:36.910
No! Stay away!

11:42.310 --> 11:45.060
Now hurry up and marry me!

11:45.060 --> 11:46.810
Gurgle, gurgle, gurgle, gurgle, gurgle!

11:54.280 --> 11:57.010
What a horrible nightmare!

11:57.010 --> 11:59.160
Are you awake, missus?

12:00.030 --> 12:03.390
Your breakfast is ready, missus.

12:03.790 --> 12:05.740
I'm no missus.

12:05.740 --> 12:07.900
I do beg your pardon.

12:13.210 --> 12:14.840
This looks great!

12:15.400 --> 12:18.180
Here we have the chef's specialty, 
scrambled eggs and croissants,

12:18.180 --> 12:22.100
carefully prepared with
 the finest ingredients.

12:22.360 --> 12:25.100
Please enjoy them while they are still hot.

12:25.100 --> 12:27.910
I see no reason to object to that.

12:27.910 --> 12:29.360
Thank you for the food.

12:34.960 --> 12:36.410
It's so good!

12:36.410 --> 12:37.960
I am pleased to hear it.

12:42.040 --> 12:44.090
How is the water temperature?

12:44.870 --> 12:47.340
Perfect!

12:48.750 --> 12:50.540
I am pleased to hear it.

12:54.500 --> 12:57.510
My, you have such gorgeous hair.

12:58.510 --> 12:59.540
You think so?

12:59.540 --> 13:00.480
Yes.

13:01.080 --> 13:02.310
Thanks!

13:03.290 --> 13:06.990
I took the liberty of ordering dresses 
designed specifically for you, missus.

13:06.990 --> 13:09.500
Wow! Those are fabulous!

13:10.140 --> 13:13.760
And here we have the dresses that 
Prince Clarke selected personally.

13:13.760 --> 13:17.200
Uh, I may have to pass on those.

13:17.200 --> 13:18.130
Certainly.

13:24.490 --> 13:26.480
It looks lovely on you, missus.

13:26.480 --> 13:29.360
I'm no missus, but thank you.

13:30.900 --> 13:33.060
Well then, I shall see you again shortly.

13:33.060 --> 13:34.580
Thank you.

13:34.580 --> 13:36.000
Please excuse me.

13:36.820 --> 13:37.420
Now's my chance!

13:37.420 --> 13:38.550
Huh?

13:41.930 --> 13:45.730
Sorry about that! 
I just really want my freedom!

13:49.290 --> 13:51.850
Oh brother. Come on.

13:53.570 --> 13:57.360
Somebody help! It's the missus!

14:28.760 --> 14:30.140
Ouch!

14:31.520 --> 14:34.230
Oh, my poor little butt...

14:35.360 --> 14:36.360
Lettie.

14:36.940 --> 14:37.730
Huh?

14:40.720 --> 14:41.910
Are you unharmed?

14:41.910 --> 14:43.500
Prince Clarke?

14:53.960 --> 14:54.860
Wuh?

14:58.910 --> 15:02.920
It appears I still need to impress 
upon you that there is no escape.

15:04.000 --> 15:06.930
Oh, come on!

15:18.550 --> 15:21.660
My plan to live a free, tranquil life 
has completely gone to pot.

15:21.660 --> 15:23.520
But just when I was at my wits' end,

15:23.520 --> 15:26.250
they started feeding me these 
exquisite meals and croissants!

15:26.250 --> 15:29.230
And the bath was warm, 
and it smelled so good!

15:29.230 --> 15:30.630
It was, let me think...

15:30.630 --> 15:31.780
Lavender.

15:31.780 --> 15:36.000
Yeah, lavender! Then they gave me
 these dresses to die for.

15:36.000 --> 15:38.610
Well, the prince's were,
to put it nicely, rather eccentric.

15:38.610 --> 15:40.470
Not so nicely, they were totally lam— Oh!

15:40.470 --> 15:42.100
I'm not letting them butter me up!

15:46.300 --> 15:48.250
Please enjoy it while it is still hot.

15:56.060 --> 15:57.190
This is delicious.

15:57.660 --> 15:59.190
I am pleased to hear it.

16:00.070 --> 16:03.720
I'm sorry for rushing you like 
that before. Are you hurt at all?

16:03.720 --> 16:06.250
No, I am perfectly fine. See?

16:11.180 --> 16:14.380
Pardon, missus... What might be the matter?

16:14.380 --> 16:15.900
How old are you?

16:15.900 --> 16:17.630
I am seventeen.

16:17.630 --> 16:20.830
Hmm. We're just about the same height.

16:20.830 --> 16:23.200
Standing next to you, it does appear so.

16:23.200 --> 16:25.110
And we have similar figures.

16:25.110 --> 16:27.200
I suppose... we do.

16:27.900 --> 16:31.720
Pray tell, you're not considering doing
something improper, are you?

16:31.720 --> 16:35.950
It's fine, it's fine! All you have to do 
is keep quiet and swap clothes with me.

16:35.950 --> 16:37.730
That's it. Okay?

16:38.020 --> 16:39.620
That is anything but okay!

16:39.620 --> 16:42.090
Oh, why not? It's fine to 
trade places now and then.

16:42.090 --> 16:44.190
No, it is not!

16:44.630 --> 16:46.440
What was your name again?

16:46.440 --> 16:48.380
It's Maria.

16:48.380 --> 16:51.200
Maria! What a nice name.

16:53.660 --> 16:56.270
This'll be a lot easier for you if you give in.

17:02.420 --> 17:03.500
What's wrong, Lettie?!

17:03.500 --> 17:05.350
Help me, please!

17:05.350 --> 17:06.290
Lettie...

17:06.760 --> 17:08.060
Prince Clarke?

17:08.060 --> 17:09.060
What are you d—

17:09.060 --> 17:09.580
Oh!

17:09.580 --> 17:10.100
Hup!

17:10.100 --> 17:11.170
Hey!

17:12.350 --> 17:15.800
She was going to make me take 
her place so she could escape.

17:15.800 --> 17:17.170
You tattletale!

17:17.170 --> 17:21.770
Lettie, what do you think that would 
that have accomplished, anyway?

17:21.770 --> 17:26.250
I guess I thought it would buy me 
some time while I ran off.

17:26.250 --> 17:28.030
Or something.

17:30.160 --> 17:33.740
I guess this means you've yet 
to accept my feelings for you.

17:33.740 --> 17:36.740
Are you angry, Your Highness?

17:37.130 --> 17:41.250
For now, why don't I elucidate 
exactly how I feel about you?

17:41.250 --> 17:43.250
Creepy, creepy, creepy, creepy,
creepy, creepy, creepy, creepy...

17:41.870 --> 17:45.250
Slowly and thoroughly.

17:45.250 --> 17:47.540
Well then, I shall return when needed.

17:47.540 --> 17:48.650
See you later!

17:48.650 --> 17:50.160
Please excuse me.

17:52.910 --> 17:56.260
And now, it's just us.

17:56.820 --> 17:59.640
Can't we talk like two very close friends?

18:15.910 --> 18:19.330
He finally let me go...

18:25.240 --> 18:29.810
Your skin radiates like the glow 
of a pure white lily blossom.

18:30.300 --> 18:35.980
Your blushing cheeks are like just-bloomed 
roses, freshly illuminated with color.

18:35.980 --> 18:38.110
Your long and beautiful locks glisten,

18:38.110 --> 18:41.680
as if reflecting the light of the 
Milky Way flowing across the night sky.

18:42.160 --> 18:46.550
When you look at me, your eyes 
sparkle as brilliantly as rubies.

18:46.550 --> 18:51.940
The voice from your lips sings like
the chirping of a precious baby bird.

18:51.940 --> 18:56.410
It is a melody to which 
my heart cannot help but dance!

18:57.040 --> 19:00.320
You are indeed the ideal princess for me!

19:00.820 --> 19:02.700
I like you, Lettie.

19:08.150 --> 19:10.600
You must be overjoyed, missus.

19:11.000 --> 19:13.340
Wuh? Why?

19:13.340 --> 19:18.290
He dragged me back here, locked me up, 
and now he's forcing me to marry him!

19:19.380 --> 19:23.350
Did Prince Clarke not express 
the depths of his feelings for you?

19:24.540 --> 19:25.770
I guess he did.

19:25.770 --> 19:30.110
And even so, you refuse to accept them
and instead plot your escape?

19:33.210 --> 19:37.590
Well, maybe that is kind of bad on my part,

19:38.380 --> 19:41.950
but it isn't right to lock me up 
without even asking me how <i>I</i> feel!

19:41.950 --> 19:43.870
There must be some other way, right?

19:44.300 --> 19:47.370
I believe he has exhausted 
all of his other options.

19:47.370 --> 19:51.130
That can't be true... Can it?

19:52.140 --> 19:54.630
Well, it is not my place to say.

19:54.630 --> 19:56.530
Whoa, talk about cold!

19:56.530 --> 19:59.070
She was perfectly nice before, 
but now she's so severe!

19:59.070 --> 20:02.910
Now then, I shall see myself out.
Please sleep well, missus.

20:02.910 --> 20:05.390
Can I get you to stop calling me "missus"?

20:05.390 --> 20:07.660
But you <i>are</i> the missus.

20:07.660 --> 20:09.520
I'm not even married.

20:09.520 --> 20:12.400
I have been instructed 
to address you as such.

20:12.400 --> 20:13.980
Whose idea was that?

20:13.980 --> 20:15.660
Prince Clarke's.

20:15.660 --> 20:17.610
Without even asking...

20:17.610 --> 20:19.300
Well then, please excuse me.

20:19.300 --> 20:20.940
Good night.

20:37.830 --> 20:39.610
What a pretty moon.

20:43.600 --> 20:44.910
It's a full moon.

20:53.620 --> 20:55.860
Wait, have I been left alone?

20:55.860 --> 20:57.860
I can escape the heck out of here now!

21:15.780 --> 21:19.430
This time, I'm really free!

21:20.340 --> 21:21.590
Wuh?

21:22.950 --> 21:24.100
Huh?

21:33.470 --> 21:34.640
Ah...

21:35.980 --> 21:37.480
What?!

21:37.750 --> 21:39.260
Hey, Lettie.

21:39.260 --> 21:43.290
To match your wedding dress, would you 
prefer a necklace of diamonds or pearls?

21:44.170 --> 21:45.870
Prince Clarke...

21:45.870 --> 21:48.680
I really don't think this is the time.

23:19.960 --> 23:39.980
<b>Next Time</b>

23:20.090 --> 23:25.090
It isn't good at all. I just want my freedom...

23:20.960 --> 23:26.010
Finish your princess lessons and find <i>love</i>

23:21.960 --> 23:26.970
So they're treating me like one of the nobles who betrayed him

23:22.960 --> 23:27.970
Death muffin roulette!

23:23.970 --> 23:28.970
Prince Clarke's personal diary?

23:26.010 --> 23:31.010
Wouldn't it be perfect if his darling Lettie came to see him on her own accord?

23:27.340 --> 23:32.350
So... please forgive me for that

23:28.850 --> 23:33.850
I've won! I've finally won!

23:30.350 --> 23:35.350
I'm sure he must be frustrated right now

23:31.850 --> 23:36.850
How could he make someone fall for him without even trying?

23:37.310 --> 23:39.980
What a farce...
